# Intelephense version devbot provisions for the opencode PHP LSP.
#
# Preferred over the copy opencode bundles (1.16.5): 1.18.5 fixes "Memory leak
# due to old syntax tree fragments accumulating while editing", and 1.18.0 fixes
# duplicate indexing on file-change events — both the traffic pattern an agentic
# editor produces. install.sh provisions exactly this version (on devbot install
# and update). Bump it with a deliberate commit — no script rewrites this file,
# so the release checkout never goes dirty.
INTELEPHENSE_VERSION=1.18.5
